<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>God gives the sunshine and God gives the rain.</l><l>All His gifts are freely given to everyone the same.</l><l>God gives the food we eat, whoever we may be.</l><l>And His love is freely given to you and me.</l><l>Thank You, God. Thank You, Thank You God.</l><l>Thank You, God. Thank You, Thank You God.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
